# Scenario 'browser_r2': ホームページ against the round-2 synthetic site (traces/web/r2, web=r2), written to reach renderer paths that the round-1 pages
# never used: title longer than 19 bytes (cut with "…"), <hr width=N / N%>, <div align=..>, <br clear=..>, entities (&lt; &gt; &amp; &quot; &nbsp; and broken ones),
# comments (including unterminated ones), nested <ul>/<ol> with more than nine items, <pre> with CR LF, <meta r_code=ng d_code=..> (page result error), links
# with the schemes ftp/mailto and paths ../ ./ /, and 27 one-image pages (image widths 1-15 as plain / <center> / <div align=right> / align=left|right|top|middle|bottom,
# each page holds ONE image: two different images on one page crashed the ROM in the harness, the PC runs into the zero bank 03, see docs/research/dynamic_tracing.md
# section 11), plus two pages larger than the renderer's limit ("ホームページがおおきすぎて すべてひょうじ できませんでした"). B on the first page shows
# "もどれるページが ありません". Keep-alive note: the adapter session times out (libmobile `End session (timeout)`) when the ROM is not polling for ~240 frames, so key bursts are
# at most 6 taps followed by an idle gap. One connection lasts less than the 9:30 connection-time notice. Starts from the state left by 'browser_bookmarks'.
# Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # title -> top menu (the first A is swallowed by the logo)
waitstable 60 max 600
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap A                        # ホームページ
waitstable 60 max 900
shot pagelist_tutorial_1
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
shot prompt
tap A                        # ホームページ
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A                        # password screen
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 1200
shot index
shot r2_index
tap B
wait 200
shot no_previous_page
tap A
wait 200
